                                <div id=\"collapse_2_3\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse niveau-2\" aria-labelledby=\"headingmenu_item_2_3\" data-bs-parent=\"#collapse_1_4\">\n                                            <div class=\"accordion-body niveau-2\">\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                                    <a href=\"/article-page/festival-de-carcassonne\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/16151\">Festival de Carcassonne</a>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                                    <a href=\"/article-page/lembrasement-de-la-cite-de-carcassonne\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/12074\">L &#039;embrasement de la Cité</a>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                                    <a href=\"/article-page/feria-de-carcassonne\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/13582\">Feria de Carcassonne</a>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                                    <a href=\"/article-page/la-magie-de-noel\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/17514\">La Magie de Noël</a>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"accordion-item item-below\">\n                            <h2 class=\"accordion-header niveau-1\" id=\"headingmenu_item_1_5\">\n                                <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse_1_5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse_1_5\">Patrimoine et histoire\n                        </button>\n                            </h2>\n                            <div id=\"collapse_1_5\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse niveau-1\" aria-labelledby=\"headingmenu_item_1_5\" data-bs-parent=\"#collapse_0_5\">\n                                <div class=\"accordion-body niveau-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/carte-interactive-des-lieux-remarquables\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/18113\" class=\"is-active\" aria-current=\"page\">Carte interactive des lieux remarquables</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/bastide-saint-louis\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7488\">Bastide Saint-Louis</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/canal-du-midi\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7537\">Canal du Midi</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/pont-vieux\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7536\">Pont Vieux</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/la-cite-medievale\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7480\">La Cité Médiévale</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/personnages-celebres\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7722\">Personnages célèbres</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/les-edifices-religieux\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/7723\">Les édifices religieux</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                                        <a href=\"/article-page/edifices-hors-bastide-saint-louis-et-hors-cite-medievale\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/18147\">Autres édifices</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"accordion-item \">\n                <a href=\"/article-page/recherche\" title=\"Pour rechercher n&#039;importe quel contenu dans le site\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/12424\">Recherche</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n</div></div></nav></div></div></div></header>\n<main role=\"main\" class=\"main-container container  js-quickedit-main-content\">\n    <div>\n        <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"main-content\">\n        <a id=\"back-to-top\">\n            <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Aller en haut de la page</span>\n        </a>\n        <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n        <div>\n            <div id=\"block-boot5-content\">\n                <!-- Back to top button -->\n                <a id=\"back-to-top\">\n                    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Aller en haut de la page</span>\n                </a>\n                <article data-history-node-id=\"18113\" class=\"article full clearfix\" id=\"export-content\">\n                    <div class=\"entete-page avec-image\">\n                        <div class=\"layout-normal zone-entete col-12 col-lg-10 offset-lg-1 col-xl-8 offset-xl-2\">\n                            <div class=\"row row-surtitre align-items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-9\">\n                                    <div class=\"field field--name-field-sur-titre field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item\">Patrimoine et histoire\n      </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"row row-titre\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-9\">\n                                    <h1 class=\"page-title\">\n                                        <span>Carte interactive des lieux remarquables</span>\n                                    </h1>\n                                    <div class=\"all-child-inline\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"etiquettes\">\n                                        <div class=\"field field--name-field-domaine field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field--item\">\n                                            <a href=\"/domaine/patrimoine-et-histoire\" hreflang=\"fr\">Patrimoine et histoire</a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"gallery-container\" id=\"id-field_image_panoramique-18113\">\n                                <a class=\"gallery-item pointer\" data-src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/max_1300x1300/public/article/field_image_panoramique/2022-02/cite-1500x500.jpg?itok=VnfZgIxq\">\n                                    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Zoom de l\'image</span>\n                                    <div class=\"field field-name-field-image-panoramique\">\n                                        <picture>\n                                            <source srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/panoramique_wide/public/article/field_image_panoramique/2022-02/cite-1500x500.jpg?h=2e916daa&amp;itok=_d0YMp-h 1x\" media=\"all and (min-width: 1200px)\" type=\"image/jpeg\" width=\"1500\" height=\"500\"/>\n                                            <source srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/panoramique_narrow/public/article/field_image_panoramique/2022-02/cite-1500x500.jpg?h=2e916daa&amp;itok=ZVqgiGxF 1x\" media=\"all and (min-width: 992px)\" type=\"image/jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"400\"/>\n                                            <img loading=\"eager\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/paysage_mobile/public/article/field_image_panoramique/2022-02/cite-1500x500.jpg?h=2e916daa&amp;itok=WS5OHuxh\" alt=\"\"/>\n                                        </picture>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"layout-normal zone-gauche col-12 col-lg-10 offset-lg-1 col-xl-8 offset-xl-2\">\n                            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\">\n                                <p>C\'est à Carcassonne que se croisent deux grands axes de circulation utilisés depuis la plus haute antiquité &nbsp;: de l\'Atlantique à la Méditerranée et du Massif Central à l\'Espagne.</p>\n                                <p>\n                                    La ville se compose de deux parties bien distinctes. <a data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"efd1130c-ca21-4ef1-842f-a7c5d8b879d9\" href=\"/article-page/la-cite-medievale\">La Cité</a>\n                                    occupe un plateau sur la rive droite de l\'Aude. La <a data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"af85403c-f6a3-4a7f-a567-e9234e7b8fc4\" href=\"/article-page/bastide-saint-louis\">Bastide Saint-Louis</a>\n                                    s\'étend sur la rive gauche.<br>\n                                    <br/>\n                                    Le vieux quartier de la Trivalle et le célèbre <a data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"7398d6a0-659c-4d30-8391-702ecae97d46\" href=\"/article-page/pont-vieux\">Pont Vieux</a>\n                                    sont, depuis cette époque, les liens qui unissent leur destinée.<br>\n                                    <br/>Carcassonne a hérité de 2000 ans d\'histoire et vous invite à découvrir son patrimoine de monuments remarquables.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"field field--name-field-paragraph field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items\">\n                                <div class=\"field field--name-field-paragraph field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--item\">\n                                    <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--vue-pleine-largeur paragraph--view-mode--default clearfix\" id=\"paragraph-id-5122\">\n                                        <div class=\"\">\n                                            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nom-de-la-vue field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item\">\n                                                <div class=\"views-element-container\">\n                                                    <div class=\"shadow-radius\">\n                                                        <div class=\"view-content\">\n                                                            <div class=\"geolocation-map-wrapper\" 