(959, 1, '2025-01-11 01:14:19', '2025-01-11 00:14:19', '<!-- wp:kubio/section {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"kNAY5_L8zR\",\"hash\":\"jGpODhpla5\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"#f2f2f2\"},\"typography\":{\"holders\":{\"p\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h1\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h2\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h3\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h4\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h5\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h6\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"}}},\"separators\":{\"top\":{\"enabled\":false,\"height\":{\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"bottom\":{\"enabled\":false,\"height\":{\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Content 1\"},\"anchor\":\"content-1\",\"kubioAI\":{\"meta\":{\"category\":\"content\",\"cloudPresetId\":813}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"3hG0g1GRT8\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"itemsPerRow\":2,\"custom\":[{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":33.33,\"unit\":\"%\"}},{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":66.66,\"unit\":\"%\"}}],\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"verticalGap\":3,\"horizontalGap\":3},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"layout\":{\"horizontalGap\":3}}}},\"hash\":\"Uw6PRtxIu6\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"GzfmXeueOV\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":41.69,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}},\"hash\":\"dNa80dew9\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"horizontalInnerGap\":3,\"verticalInnerGap\":3,\"verticalAlign\":\"center\",\"vSpace\":{\"value\":40,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/heading {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"OWQJTYir94\",\"props\":{\"level\":3,\"fancy\":{\"fancyRotatingWords\":\"awesome\\namazing\\nimpressive\"}},\"hash\":\"5sb6h3MeUf\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"typography\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-6),1)\"}}}}}} -->\nUne population attachée\n<!-- /wp:kubio/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"vwH6CaLBMD\",\"hash\":\"csHVaPPYq\",\"props\":{\"isLead\":false},\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"typography\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-6),1)\"},\"textAlign\":\"justify\"}}}}} -->\nCarcassonne possède une population variée. En effet, alors que nous sommes en 2021, certains ménages sont installés depuis plusieurs décennies quand d\'autres viennent à peine de s\'installer. Cette diversité montre l\'attractivité de Carcassonne pour les nouveaux habitants ainsi que l\'attachement des habitants de longue date. \n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"uRyaVODVB5o\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":58.3,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}},\"hash\":\"Ovqk_xeIv\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"bottom\":{\"radius\":{\"right\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}},\"background\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"image\":[{\"source\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Capture-decran-2025-01-09-152201.png\"},\"position\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50},\"size\":\"contain\"}]},\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":500,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}}}} /-->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/section {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"ObgAPNjc5\",\"hash\":\"jGpODhpla5\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"#f2f2f2\"},\"typography\":{\"holders\":{\"p\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h1\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h2\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h3\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h4\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h5\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"h6\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"}}},\"separators\":{\"top\":{\"enabled\":false,\"height\":{\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"bottom\":{\"enabled\":false,\"height\":{\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Content 1\"},\"anchor\":\"content-1\",\"kubioAI\":{\"meta\":{\"category\":\"content\",\"cloudPresetId\":813}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"3hG0g1GRT8\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"itemsPerRow\":2,\"custom\":[{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":33.33,\"unit\":\"%\"}},{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":66.66,\"unit\":\"%\"}}],\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"verticalGap\":3,\"horizontalGap\":3},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"layout\":{\"horizontalGap\":3}}}},\"hash\":\"Uw6PRtxIu6\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"V_wtqVQRn\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":58.3,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}},\"hash\":\"gHtL3ZPRj\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"bottom\":{\"radius\":{\"right\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}},\"background\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"image\":[{\"source\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Capture-decran-2025-01-09-143641-1.png\"},\"position\":{\"x\":50,\"y\":50},\"size\":\"contain\"}]},\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":500,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}}}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"bFVeuGT5w\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":41.69,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}},\"hash\":\"dNa80dew9\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"horizontalInnerGap\":3,\"verticalInnerGap\":3,\"verticalAlign\":\"center\",\"vSpace\":{\"value\":40,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/heading {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"OWQJTYir94\",\"props\":{\"level\":3,\"fancy\":{\"fancyRotatingWords\":\"awesome\\namazing\\nimpressive\"}},\"hash\":\"DtFwrq6eVw\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"typography\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-6),1)\"}}}}}} -->\nUn fort taux de scolarisation\n<!-- /wp:kubio/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"vwH6CaLBMD\",\"hash\":\"oStpWcCUf\",\"props\":{\"isLead\":false},\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"typography\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-6),1)\"},\"textAlign\":\"justify\"}}}}} -->\nIci, à Carcassonne nous mettons tout en œuvre pour faciliter l\'accès à l\'éducation. <br>Il est primordial que tous les habitant puissent étudier où ils le souhaitent, cela grâce notamment aux bourses et aux aides à l\'éducation.\n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/section -->', 'Des chiffres !', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '706-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-01-11 01:14:19', '2025-01-11 00:14:19', '', 706, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=959', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
