wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"5tK2paJEcP\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"verticalInnerGap\":0}},\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"hash\":\"9ftTdXMqL\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"#f2f2f2\"}}}}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"z_9slk2tlW\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"itemsPerRow\":1,\"custom\":[{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}],\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"verticalGap\":0}},\"hash\":\"nzuCDH9NHw\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"LpsYWeX_Hd\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":47,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"tablet\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":40,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"hash\":\"YhwJsr02c\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]},\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":436,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"background\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"image\":[{\"source\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/muy-mucho.jpg\"},\"position\":{\"x\":36,\"y\":43}}]},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":400,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}},\"border\":{\"top\":{\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"right\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"bottom\":{\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"right\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"left\":{\"style\":\"solid\"}},\"boxShadow\":{\"enabled\":false}}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"verticalInnerGap\":0,\"verticalAlign\":\"start\",\"vSpace\":{\"value\":21,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"8LoANFZw3LZ\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"border\":{\"top\":{\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"style\":\"solid\"},\"bottom\":{\"radius\":{\"right\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"style\":\"solid\"},\"right\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"left\":{\"style\":\"solid\"}},\"padding\":{\"top\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"left\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"right\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":-100,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]}}},\"margin\":{\"top\":{\"value\":5,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":5,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"left\":{\"value\":\"\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"right\":{\"value\":\"\",\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"boxShadow\":{\"enabled\":true}}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"verticalAlign\":\"center\"}},\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":40,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"tablet\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":60,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"hash\":\"O6_TfY9AD0\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"J3vWfzreaUs\",\"hash\":\"2eMrVXOKwG\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"textAlign\":\"justify\"}}}}} -->\nCarcassonne met un point d’honneur à soutenir ses commerçants et artisans grâce au programme <strong>Action Cœur de Ville (2023-2026)</strong>. Ce dispositif offre des <strong>aides financières significatives</strong> pour encourager l’installation et l’amélioration des points de vente situés en centre-ville.\n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"J3vWfzreaUs\",\"hash\":\"bRa-ioO9L\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"textAlign\":\"justify\"}}}}} -->\n<br>Les <strong>subventions peuvent couvrir jusqu’à 50 % des investissements</strong>, avec un plafond de <strong>5000 €</strong>. En 2024, ce programme a été élargi pour inclure davantage de types d’activités. Les priorités sont données à :<br>\n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Les <strong>commerces vacants depuis plus de 12 mois</strong> pour revitaliser le tissu commercial local.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Les activités répondant à des <strong>besoins spécifiques</strong> identifiés dans le centre-ville.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Les entreprises offrant des <strong>horaires élargis</strong>, permettant une meilleure accessibilité pour les habitants et visiteurs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/section {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"52uXaT71uv\",\"hash\":\"3xfOz8DxFb\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"#f2f2f2\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}},\"props\":{\"width\":\"full-width\"}},\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Section\"},\"anchor\":\"section\"} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"NSjbHYuMK\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"itemsPerRow\":1,\"custom\":[{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}],\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"horizontalGap\":1,\"verticalGap\":0}},\"hash\":\"71cx5SK5U\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"UmUSKYR_MW\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}},\"hash\":\"t7uajoHcA\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"vSpace\":{\"value\":13,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"verticalAlign\":\"start\",\"horizontalInnerGap\":2,\"verticalInnerGap\":0}},\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"}}}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/heading {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"UX9lc49lgt\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"text\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\"}}},\"props\":{\"level\":3,\"fancy\":{\"fancyRotatingWords\":\"génial\\ngénial\\nimpressionnant\"}},\"hash\":\"OwZ-FDf0o\"}} -->\n<strong><strong>Espaces de Coworking et Télétravail : Une Économie Dynamique</strong></strong>\n<!-- /wp:kubio/heading -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"Ysun-ZSdnz\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"horizontalAlign\":\"start\",\"horizontalGap\":2,\"verticalGap\":0,\"verticalInnerGap\":0,\"horizontalInnerGap\":0}},\"hash\":\"tTgnznMij\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"EYRQJxsttD\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"vSpace\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"horizontalInnerGap\":1,\"verticalInnerGap\":0}},\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"hash\":\"DQZap0kCX\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/divider {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"HSsECAaRpe\",\"props\":{\"type\":\"line\"},\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":{\"value\":\"10\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"top\":{\"value\":\"10\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"line\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"left\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"right\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"bottom\":{\"width\":{\"value\":4,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-1),1)\",\"style\":\"solid\"}}},\"inner\":{\"fill\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-1),1)\",\"width\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"margin\":{\"left\":{\"value\":\"10\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":\"10\",\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"width-container\":{\"width\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}},\"hash\":\"HgRajDpDFg\"},\"iconName\":\"font-awesome/star\"} /-->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/row -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/section {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"2CAPZ6WCRH\",\"hash\":\"HPhgBwedeP\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-6),0.05)\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}}},\"props\":{\"width\":\"full-width\"}},\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Portfolio 1\"},\"anchor\":\"portfolio-1\",\"kubioAI\":{\"meta\":{\"category\":\"portfolio\",\"cloudPresetId\":763}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"aR6PoXeFhI\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"horizontalGap\":0,\"verticalGap\":0}},\"hash\":\"p0U_lCit0B\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"efeNWIENtT3\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"verticalInnerGap\":0}},\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}}}}}},\"hash\":\"KT3tovuuQ\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"#f2f2f2\"}}}}}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/row {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"__C0L4wM9n\",\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"itemsPerRow\":1,\"custom\":[{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"}}],\"equalHeight\":true,\"equalWidth\":false,\"verticalGap\":0}},\"hash\":\"0mAO1mh2sdK\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"4RJFdqMgF8o\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"background\":{\"color\":\"rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1)\"},\"border\":{\"top\":{\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"bottom\":{\"radius\":{\"right\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":20,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}},\"padding\":{\"top\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"left\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"right\":{\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]},\"z-index\":\"1\",\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]}}},\"margin\":{\"top\":{\"value\":5,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":5,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"boxShadow\":{\"enabled\":true}}}},\"props\":{\"layout\":{\"verticalAlign\":\"center\"}},\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":41.91,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"tablet\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":60,\"unit\":\"%\"}}},\"mobile\":{\"order\":2}}}}},\"hash\":\"WhLjrJ_I-\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"QK2vGWdG7vT\",\"hash\":\"uYffIFC26\"}} -->\nDepuis 2017, Carcassonne Agglo mise sur le <strong>coworking</strong> pour s’adapter aux nouvelles formes de travail. Avec ses <strong>400 m² dédiés</strong>, l’espace coworking est idéal pour les entrepreneurs, les télétravailleurs et les indépendants.\n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/text {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"thA0Sy2TJTl\",\"hash\":\"k6l-PCo2F\"}} -->\n<strong>Voici ce que l’espace propose</strong> :<br><strong>Internet ultra haut débit</strong> (1 Gb/s) pour travailler efficacement.\n<!-- /wp:kubio/text -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quatre bureaux privatifs</strong> pour plus d’intimité.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Un <strong>open space</strong> collaboratif favorisant les échanges et les projets communs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Une <strong>salle de réunion moderne</strong> de 60 m², idéale pour accueillir jusqu’à 18 personnes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Un <strong>espace détente</strong> pour créer un équilibre entre travail et bien-être.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:kubio/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kubio/column {\"kubio\":{\"styleRef\":\"-lCiK0UbL51\",\"_style\":{\"descendants\":{\"container\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":45.5,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"tablet\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":40,\"unit\":\"%\"}}},\"mobile\":{\"order\":1}}}}},\"hash\":\"QCnem1cSC\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"inner\":{\"transform\":{\"translate\":[{\"axis\":\"x\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"y\",\"value\":{\"value\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"}},{\"axis\":\"z\"}]},\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":600,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"background\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"image\":[{\"source\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/coworking.jpg\"},\"position\":{\"x\":37,\"y\":56}}]},\"media\":{\"tablet\":{\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":700,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"mobile\":{\"customHeight\":{\"type\":\"min-height\",\"min-height\":{\"value\":400,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}},\"border\":{\"top\":{\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"left\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"px\"}}},\"right\":{\"style\":\"solid\"},\"bottom\":{\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"righ